{"id":"n70785-1-8","stage":2,"title":"일상 · 日常","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70785-1-8-1","ko":"나는 요즘 일상이 너무 재미없어.","zh":"我最近觉得日常生活太无趣了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"일상이","meaning":"日常，日常生活，平常","explanation":"일상：日常，日常生活，平常；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일상","audio":"/audio/2513c886e137082c1a4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70785","senseId":"1","lemma":"일상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일상이","audio":"/audio/04b5ef445f6807e739c5.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"재미없어.","meaning":"无趣，没意思，没劲儿","explanation":"재미없다：无趣，没意思，没劲儿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미없다","audio":"/audio/b086b052fd147207e465.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57315","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미없어","audio":"/audio/d2c9a039270acd7d0f20.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘"